                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Forest Essentials' biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Category-defining luxury Ayurveda positioning + high-touch retail + packaging craftsmanship. 15+ years of category leadership.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new luxury Ayurveda brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>In sub-category niching (single-ingredient focus, specific ritual specialisation) yes. Full luxury Ayurveda category is Forest Essentials + Kama Ayurveda dominant.</p>
                                        <h3>Is physical retail essential for luxury beauty?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for most luxury. Digital-only luxury rarely works past a certain scale — trial + touch + experience matter.</p>
                                        <h3>Does Estée Lauder own Forest Essentials?</h3>
